**What this file does:** It serves as the master blueprint and instruction manual for anyone looking at or working on your repository. 

**Where to place it:** At the root of your project folder (`pesigninfo-maker/README.md`).

**Why it matters:** A professional README signals to investors, future hires, and open-source auditors that this is an enterprise-grade project. It provides instant onboarding instructions so new engineers can spin up the platform on their local machines in minutes without asking you basic questions.

